        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.142,
            0.391,
            0.16
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Complete these expressions.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.169,
            0.388,
            0.188
          ],
          "content": "a. (+ 40) + = + 200"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.478,
            0.168,
            0.72,
            0.188
          ],
          "content": "b. (+ 40) + \\_ \\_ = – 200"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.196,
            0.388,
            0.214
          ],
          "content": "c. (– 50) + = + 200"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.478,
            0.195,
            0.721,
            0.215
          ],
          "content": "d. (– 50) + \\_ = – 200"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.224,
            0.406,
            0.242
          ],
          "content": "e. (– 200) – (– 40) ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.478,
            0.223,
            0.727,
            0.242
          ],
          "content": "f. (+ 200) – (+ 40) ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.251,
            0.407,
            0.27
          ],
          "content": "g. (– 200) – (+ 40) ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.277,
            0.619,
            0.324
          ],
          "content": "Ans. a. (+160) b. (-240) c. (+250) d. (-150) e. (-160) f. (+160) g. (-240)"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.359,
            0.238,
            0.378
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Page No. 252"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.387,
            0.881,
            0.423
          ],
          "content": "**Q. In the other exercises that you did above, did you notice that subtracting a negative number was the same as adding the corresponding positive number?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.432,
            0.585,
            0.45
          ],
          "content": "Ans. Yes. The infinite lift reminds us of a number line."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.459,
            0.86,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": "**Q. If, from 5 you wish to go over to 9, how far must you travel along the number line?** Ans. 4 steps."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.513,
            0.881,
            0.559
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Now, from 9, if you wish to go to 3, how much must you travel along the number line?** Ans. One must travel 6 steps backward or move (-6) from 9 to go to 3."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.595,
            0.686,
            0.613
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Now, from 3, if you wish to go to – 2, how far must you travel?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.622,
            0.717,
            0.64
          ],
          "content": "Ans. One must travel 5 steps backward or move (-5) from 3 to go to -2."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.676,
            0.236,
            0.694
          ],
          "content": "**Page No. 253**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.704,
            0.233,
            0.722
          ],
          "content": "**Figure it out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
