            0.803
          ],
          "content": "**Q1. Mark 3 positive numbers and 3 negative numbers on the number line above.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.812,
            0.391,
            0.829
          ],
          "content": "Ans. Mark A = 2, B = 5, C = 8"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
